# This file is intentionally not a runtime configuration source.
#
# Backend configuration is centralized in backend/.env and is loaded by both
# local development and Docker Compose. Create it from the maintained template:
#
#   Copy-Item backend/.env.example backend/.env
#
# Do not put backend runtime variables in this root file. Docker Compose does
# not load it, which would otherwise make configuration appear to succeed while
# the backend receives different values.
